# Atlas: the store (`.atlas/cas/`, `projection*.json`, `staging*.json`) is local derived state and Atlas refuses
# to serve a committed one. Only the admin policy and the append-only logs and blobs under `project/`,
# `members/`, `cards/` and `blobs/` travel (`modules/atlas/packages/adapter-io/src/layout.ts`). `mine-exclude` is
# the operator's genesis site-filter override, committed so the atlas-genesis runner applies it.
/.atlas/*
!/.atlas/project/
!/.atlas/members/
!/.atlas/blobs/
!/.atlas/cards/
!/.atlas/policy.json
!/.atlas/mine-exclude
**/.atlas/staging*.json
